  "basis": "Named standard PMTiles bridge carriageways 35184397841630, sidewalks 35184396656430 and tram tracks 35185557817320 establish the crossing alongside original Q2100416 and two ordinary pictures; no exact-QID footprint claimed. Anchor [12.474515587091446,41.89107316243978], heading 1.5001337686119638. +X north-northeast toward Regola / Lungotevere dei Vallati and De’ Cenci, -X south-southwest toward Trastevere / Piazza Belli; +Z east-southeast/downstream toward Tiber Island, -Z west-northwest/upstream toward Ponte Sisto. Mapped carriageway extent 123.916693m, unequal endpoints and paired transport lines are retained. The inferred 23.5m outer width covers both sidewalk lines. All 48 actual mapped width samples have model support and retained native paving at every LOD: 12 road samples differ by at most 0.022683182868149743m, 24 sidewalk samples by 0.011999130248796064m, and 12 tram-bed samples by 0.06242930874486774m. The tram difference is explicitly larger; no uniform sub-3cm fit is claimed. Source datum 7m and deck 21.6–21.95m are approximate standard-terrain visualization controls, not surveyed thresholds.",
